<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/1st-century-bce">1st century BCE</a></p><h1 class="research-title">30 BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">30 BCE in world history: 10 events, 4 deaths, 1 state founded and 1 that came to an end. 172 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
